items.brief:
A facilitator stands at the centre, relaxed, with six small scenes
around her in a ring: (1) three small hall shapes followed by a house with a garden (three
courses, then home); (2) a facilitator alone setting out chairs in an empty hall (Day 0);
(3) a facilitator drinking from a water bottle, one hand raised as a quiet signal;
(4) a facilitator sitting in shade in a wide hat while groups work in the background;
(5) two facilitators talking on a bench at sunset; (6) a facilitator gently pointing a learner
toward a clinic building (a cross symbol on the building).

A homestead seen from above in the centre (house, tank, beds, fruit
trees, chicken run, swale on the slope), surrounded by twelve small round vignettes like a
clock face: (1) a woman sitting watching her yard; (2) a tank full of water and a seed jar;
(3) a hand picking spinach; (4) a person checking a flooded bed and redirecting water;
(5) the sun and rain falling on a roof; (6) kitchen scraps feeding chickens feeding compost;
(7) a view of a whole slope, then a single bed; (8) chickens beside the vegetable garden;
(9) one well-made bed; (10) many crops mixed; (11) plants thriving along a fence line;
(12) a farmer planting drought-tolerant crops under a hot sky. Thin arrows join each vignette
to the part of the homestead it relates to.
